<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2110937331"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1796369317"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="VIOLET LINE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Roselia"/><amll:meta key="album" value="VIOLET LINE"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:50.733"><div begin="00:03.707" end="04:30.952"><p begin="00:03.707" end="00:05.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="00:05.267" end="00:12.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">此処に想いを 此処に歌声を 共に交わし合おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让思念在此处 让歌声在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni o mo i wo ko ko ni u ta go e wo</span></p><p begin="00:12.304" end="00:17.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">独りじゃないんだ 皆此処にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤独 大家都齐聚于此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i n da mi n na ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="00:17.158" end="00:21.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">繋がりは永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">羁绊永不断绝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na ga ri wa e i e n ni (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="00:19.191" end="00:23.506" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="00:46.100" end="00:54.149" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">不平等に揺れる 天秤は右へ左へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天平向着左右 不平衡地摇摆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu byo u do u ni yu re ru te n bi n wa mi gi he hi da ri he to</span></p><p begin="00:55.728" end="01:03.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">だからこそ羨むことに目を向けないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以不要总把目光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ko so u ra ya mu ko to ni</span></p><p begin="01:03.953" end="01:11.305" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8">(怒りで情熱を 涙で蕾を 微笑みで明日を)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(将热情以愤怒 花蕾以泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( i ka ri de jo u ne tsu wo na mi da de tsu bo mi wo</span></p><p begin="01:11.315" end="01:13.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">育ててゆこう</p><p begin="01:13.501" end="01:18.634" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10">(全ては運命を切り開く為の)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(一切都是为了开拓命运)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( su be te wa u n me i wo ki ri hi ra ku ta me no )</span></p><p begin="01:18.099" end="01:22.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">力となり翼へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作羽翼的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka ra to na ri tsu ba sa he to</span></p><p begin="01:22.824" end="01:24.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="01:24.490" end="01:31.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">此処に想いを 此処に歌声を 共に交わし合おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让思念在此处 让歌声在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni o mo i wo ko ko ni u ta go e wo</span></p><p begin="01:31.527" end="01:36.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">独りじゃないんだ 皆此処にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤独 大家都齐聚于此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i n da mi n na ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="01:36.313" end="01:40.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">どうか忘れないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka wa su re na i de (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="01:38.427" end="01:42.035" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="01:42.050" end="01:43.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="01:43.656" end="01:50.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">震える足も 戸惑う鼓動も 誇らしく思おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的双腿也好 困惑的心跳也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru a shi mo to ma do u ko do u mo</span></p><p begin="01:50.715" end="01:54.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">さあ 行きましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 出发吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a yu ki ma sho u (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="01:52.768" end="01:56.429" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="01:56.438" end="01:59.525" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">貴方はもう大丈夫<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已无需担忧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa mo u da i jo u bu</span></p><p begin="02:10.115" end="02:18.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">易々と変わる 空模様はただ身勝手に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya su ya su to ka wa ru</span></p><p begin="02:19.624" end="02:27.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">だからこそ失うものに囚われないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因此千万不要受困于</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ko so u shi na u mo no ni</span></p><p begin="02:27.974" end="02:36.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">貴方は 貴方の為の 貴方を選べばいいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你只需要选择</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa a na ta no ta me no</span></p><p begin="02:37.268" end="02:38.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="02:38.844" end="02:45.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">此処に想いを 此処に歌声を 共に交わし合おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让思念在此处 让歌声在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni o mo i wo ko ko ni u ta go e wo</span></p><p begin="02:45.911" end="02:50.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">独りじゃないんだ 皆此処にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤独 大家都齐聚于此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i n da mi n na ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="02:50.737" end="02:54.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">いつも思い出して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时都要记得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo o mo i da shi te (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="02:52.837" end="02:56.421" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="02:56.421" end="02:58.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="02:58.093" end="03:02.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">弱音を吐いても 目を逸らしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使会说泄气话 即使会移开目光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa ne wo ha i te mo me wo so ra shi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:02.667" end="03:05.113" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">逃げてしまってもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算逃跑也没关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge te shi ma 't te mo i i</span></p><p begin="03:05.123" end="03:08.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">責めるよりも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要责怪自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se me ru yo ri mo ( oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="03:07.200" end="03:10.827" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L34">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="03:10.832" end="03:18.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">自分を抱きしめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而要拥抱自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n wo da ki shi me te</span></p><p begin="03:23.091" end="03:30.452" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L36">(誰かの正義に 誰かの常識に 誰かの価値観に)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(别人的正义 别人的常识</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( da re ka no se i gi ni da re ka no jo u shi ki ni</span></p><p begin="03:30.474" end="03:33.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">惑わされず</p><p begin="03:32.697" end="03:38.064" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L38">(全て魂と答え合わせをして)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(与自己的灵魂核对一切的答案)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( su be te ta ma shi i to ko ta e a wa se wo shi te )</span></p><p begin="03:37.353" end="03:42.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">自由に世界を躍ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由地在世界上起舞吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji yu u ni se ka i wo o do ro u</span></p><p begin="03:43.228" end="03:44.786" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="03:44.823" end="03:51.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">此処に想いを 此処に歌声を 共に交わし合おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让思念在此处 让歌声在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni o mo i wo ko ko ni u ta go e wo</span></p><p begin="03:51.905" end="03:56.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">独りじゃないんだ 皆此処にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤独 大家都齐聚于此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i n da mi n na ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="03:56.727" end="04:00.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">どうか忘れないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka wa su re na i de (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="03:58.716" end="04:02.410" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L44">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="04:02.420" end="04:04.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Hands up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hands up</span></p><p begin="04:04.052" end="04:11.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">震える足も 戸惑う鼓動も 誇らしく思おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的双腿也好 困惑的心跳也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru a shi mo to ma do u ko do u mo</span></p><p begin="04:11.093" end="04:14.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">さあ 行きましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 出发吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a yu ki ma sho u (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="04:13.236" end="04:16.867" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L48">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="04:16.877" end="04:20.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">貴方はもう大丈夫<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已无需担忧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa mo u da i jo u bu (oh oh oh)</span></p><p begin="04:20.403" end="04:24.042" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L50">(Oh oh oh...)</p><p begin="04:24.052" end="04:30.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">自分を信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n wo shi n ji te</span></p></div></body></tt>